- require_stylesheet "maintaining"

#page-maintaining-dashboard
  .lg-container.container
    %h1 Experimental editor

    %p
      The normal editor, with experimental features turned on. Right now that
      means running the tests in the browser on a wasm kernel, rather than
      sending them to the tooling fleet.
    %p
      Students never see this: the editor they use passes the flag as false and
      is unchanged.

    .links
      %h2= "#{@track.title} exercises"
      %ul
        - @exercises.each do |exercise|
          %li
            = link_to exercise.title, maintaining_experimental_editor_path(exercise.slug)
